WEBVTT

00:12:27.876 --> 00:12:32.116
It's like realizing that your insurance
policy had just expired

00:12:32.156 --> 00:12:34.276
and not renewing it?

00:12:34.716 --> 00:12:36.956
Grave danger, indeed.

00:12:37.276 --> 00:12:40.196
Your appliances, they know, you know.

00:12:40.676 --> 00:12:45.196
So we buy insurance
and restore our peace of mind.

00:12:45.516 --> 00:12:47.476
And now you're probably asking yourself,

00:12:47.476 --> 00:12:49.196
"But peace of mind is good.

00:12:49.236 --> 00:12:51.916
What's wrong with peace of mind," right?

00:12:51.956 --> 00:12:53.636
"What's the problem?"

00:12:54.116 --> 00:12:58.916
The problem is that we are highly
likely to be over-insured.

00:12:59.716 --> 00:13:01.156
What does it mean?